't see any article provided in the message. The user style seems to be for =
a different type of task - a comprehensive technical analysis in Vietnamese=
 from the perspective of a Principal Front-end Engineer.</p>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">But the actual user message is s=
imply asking for highlights from recent conversations in English. This seem=
s to be a mismatch between the user style and the actual request.</p>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Since the user is asking about r=
