<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Benefits of Event-Driven=
 Architecture:</strong></p>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Loose coupling</strong>=
: Components don't know about each other directly</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Scalability</strong>: E=
asy to add new event handlers</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Testability</strong>: E=
ach component can be tested in isolation</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Flexibility</strong>: C=
an change event handlers without touching publishers</li>
</ul>
