<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>=F0=9F=92=AD Think Out L=
oud - CQRS t=E1=BA=A1i Figma:</strong>
"T=E1=BA=A1i Figma, collaborative design editing l=C3=A0 extremely complex =
domain. Ch=C3=BAng ta c=C3=B3 hundreds of users editing same design simulta=
neously. Traditional CRUD approach wouldn't work v=C3=AC:</p>
<ol class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-decimal space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Write complexity</stron=
g>: Operational Transform algorithms, conflict resolution</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Read complexity</strong=
>: Real-time updates, version history, branching</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Scale requirements</str=
ong>: Millions of design operations per second</li>
</ol>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">CQRS solution:</p>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Command side</strong>: =
Handle design operations (move, resize, add elements)</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Query side</strong>: Se=
rve design data optimized for rendering</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Event store</strong>: T=
rack all design changes for collaboration v=C3=A0 history</li>
</ul>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Key insight: <strong>Complex dom=
ains benefit from separation of concerns between writes v=C3=A0 reads</stro=
ng>."</p>
