oud - Mediator Pattern t=E1=BA=A1i Binance:</strong>
"T=E1=BA=A1i Binance trading platform, ch=C3=BAng ta c=C3=B3 <strong>dozens=
 of components</strong> c=E1=BA=A7n communicate:</p>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Chart component</strong=
> shows price movements</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Order form</strong> pla=
ces buy/sell orders</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Portfolio tracker</stro=
ng> shows P&amp;L changes</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>News feed</strong> disp=
lays market updates</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Alert system</strong> t=
riggers price notifications</li>
</ul>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Direct communication would creat=
e <strong>spaghetti code</strong>. Mediator pattern benefits:</p>
<ol class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-decimal space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Decoupling</strong>: Co=
mponents don't know about each other</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Centralized logic</stro=
ng>: All communication flows through mediator</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Easy debugging</strong>=
: Single place =C4=91=E1=BB=83 monitor all interactions</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Middleware support</str=
ong>: Add logging, analytics, rate limiting</li>
</ol>
