<h3 class=3D"text-lg font-bold text-text-100 mt-1 -mb-1.5">=F0=9F=93=96 Int=
erface Definition - API Design at Principal Level</h3>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>=F0=9F=8C=B1 Ngu=E1=BB=
=93n G=E1=BB=91c &amp; Motivation - T=E1=BA=A1i Sao Interface Design Critic=
al:</strong></p>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Interface design kh=C3=B4ng ch=
=E1=BB=89 l=C3=A0 "define function signatures". =C4=90=C3=A2y l=C3=A0 <stro=
ng>contract design</strong> - defining how different parts c=E1=BB=A7a syst=
em communicate, evolve, v=C3=A0 maintain backward compatibility. Poor inter=
face design leads =C4=91=E1=BA=BFn <strong>brittle systems</strong>, <stron=
g>integration nightmares</strong>, v=C3=A0 <strong>developer productivity k=
ills</strong>.</p>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">=F0=9F=92=AD <strong>Principal's=
 Interface Philosophy</strong>: "T=E1=BA=A1i Webflow, khi ch=C3=BAng t=C3=
=B4i building visual design platform, interface design decisions impacted k=
h=C3=B4ng ch=E1=BB=89 internal development, m=C3=A0 c=C3=B2n <strong>third-=
party integrations</strong>, <strong>plugin ecosystem</strong>, v=C3=A0 <st=
rong>long-term platform evolution</strong>. Good interfaces enable <strong>=
platform thinking</strong> - other developers can build upon your system su=
ccessfully."</p>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>=F0=9F=94=AC Core Mechan=
ism - Contract-First Development:</strong></p>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Interface design ho=E1=BA=A1t =
=C4=91=E1=BB=99ng tr=C3=AAn principles c=E1=BB=A7a <strong>contract-first d=
evelopment</strong>. Instead c=E1=BB=A7a designing implementation first, we=
 define contracts (interfaces) first, then implement towards those contract=
