<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>=F0=9F=92=AD Think Out L=
oud - Problem Exploration Debugging:</strong></p>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">"Khi t=C3=B4i first time lead sy=
stem design interviews t=E1=BA=A1i Binance, t=C3=B4i notice pattern: <stron=
g>junior candidates ask implementation questions first</strong>, while <str=
ong>senior candidates ask business questions first</strong>.</p>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">V=C3=AD d=E1=BB=A5 =C4=91i=E1=BB=
=83n h=C3=ACnh:</p>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Junior approach</strong=
>: 'Should we use React hay Vue? MongoDB hay PostgreSQL?'</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Senior approach</strong=
>: 'What's the primary business value? Who are the users? What problems are=
 we solving?'</li>
</ul>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Insight: <strong>Technology deci=
sions should flow from business requirements, not the reverse</strong>. Whe=
n I shifted my questioning approach to business-first, solution quality imp=
roved dramatically."</p>
